00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:08,910
Those four additional-unit counts work like four
dials. The first has five settings, the second

2
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:16,080
four, the third five, and the fourth seven.
Multiply them and we get 700 possible

3
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:24,136
combinations, including the unchanged baseline.
Testing every combination under four storms

4
00:00:24,136 --> 00:00:32,103
