each, plus four baseline runs—884 runs in all.

6
00:00:40,512 --> 00:00:48,125
It is not every possibility, and it is not a
demonstration that machine learning found

7
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:55,738
a better answer. Imagine the untested
combinations as face-down cards. A search method

8
00:00:55,738 --> 00:01:02,289
may choose which card to turn over next. That
choice is a question, not an

9
00:01:02,289 --> 00:01:10,167
answer. Only a direct SWMM run can reveal the
modeled hydraulics. Search decides where to

10
00:01:10,167 --> 00:01:13,000
look. SWMM supplies what we see.
